            "title": "Progressive stock sinks on Q3 miss, gold hits yet another record",
            "description": "<p>Yahoo Finance anchor <a data-i13n=\"cpos:1;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/author/julie-hyman/\">Julie Hyman</a> tracks Wednesday's top moving stocks and biggest market stories in this<a data-i13n=\"cpos:2;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/videos/series/market-minute/\"> Market Minute</a>.</p>\n<p>Gold (<a data-i13n=\"cpos:3;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/GC=F\">GC=F</a>) notched yet another record high at $4,200.</p>\n<p>Progressive (<a data-i13n=\"cpos:4;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/PGR\">PGR</a>) stock is sinking after the company reported third quarter earnings results that missed estimates.</p>\n<p>Sana Biotechnology (<a data-i13n=\"cpos:5;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/SANA\">SANA</a>) stock is jumping after Opendoor (<a data-i13n=\"cpos:6;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/OPEN\">OPEN</a>) investor Eric Jackson announced that he's long on the stock.</p>\n<p>Stay up to date on the latest market action, minute-by-minute, with <a data-i13n=\"cpos:7;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/videos/series/market-minute/\">Yahoo Finance's Market Minute.</a></p>",
